# Real SD card data (STR.edf, DATALOG/, SETTINGS/) used for building/testing
# the EDF parser against real hardware output — this is the user's actual
# CPAP therapy history and this repo is public, so it must never be
# committed.
Sample_CPAP_Data/

# Personal hardware experiment notes (WiFi SD card sync proof of concept) —
# documents home-network specifics the user wants kept private, and this
# repo is public.
docs/wifi-sd-sync.md

# Feature spec drafted with a separate Claude.ai session, kept local at the
# user's request rather than committed to the public repo's history.
docs/trends-all-time-chart-spec.md

# WiFi SD sync sub-project: a personal fork of the FYSETC SD-WiFi card's
# stock ESPWebDAV firmware (adds CORS headers), built/flashed locally.
# Not part of AirTrace itself, same "personal, never distributed" status
# as docs/wifi-sd-sync.md above.
wifi-sd-firmware/

# CardSync: the PC-side backup/housekeeping companion script for the WiFi
# SD card, same private/personal status as the two entries above - nothing
# to do with AirTrace itself.
card-sync/

